### =============================================================
### SETUP – get your tokens (run this first!)
### =============================================================
### Log in as each user and copy the "token" from the response into
### @aliceToken / @bobToken / @adminToken in the other .http files.
### (Or use the pre-made tokens from Step 0 in workshop.html.)
### =============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5218

### [1] Log in as alice (customer)
# → copy the "token" value from the response into @aliceToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password"
}

###

### [2] Log in as bob (customer)
# → copy the "token" value from the response into @bobToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "password": "password"
}

###

### [3] Log in as admin
# → copy the "token" value from the response into @adminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}
